@baseUrl = http://localhost:8034

### Init an empty repo
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/manage/repos/sample-project

### Get lock / abandoned-transaction status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/manage/repos/sample-project

### Copy a repo onto a new code
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/manage/repos/sample-copy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceCode": "sample-project"
}

### Backup a repo as a zip
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/manage/repos/sample-project/backup

### Soft-delete a repo
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/manage/repos/sample-project/soft-delete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "suffix": "manual"
}

### Reset a repo (soft-delete + empty replacement)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/manage/repos/sample-project/reset

### Finish reset by uploading a zip (raw body)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/manage/repos/sample-project/finish-reset
Content-Type: application/zip

< ./repo-backup.zip

### Invalidate NFS dir cache
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/manage/repos/sample-project/invalidate-dir-cache

### Delete a repo if it exists
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/manage/repos/sample-project

### Dry-run cleanup of old reset backups
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/manage/reset-backups/cleanup?dryRun=true

### Invalid project code
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/manage/repos/-bad
